# This checkout is also a project that Octopus AI serves: Octopus AI is installed into itself.
# Git tracks the entry files and the rules and skills they load (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .agents/,
# .claude/settings.json, .claude/skills/): they name no machine path, so an agent opened in a
# fresh clone loads the rules. The rest holds machine paths, session ids, tickets and local
# settings, and stays out: the first run of octopus.py writes it.
/.aitools/
/.octopus/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/skills/
/.codex/
/TODO/
/CLAUDE.local.md

# Build output and local tool state
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
Binaries/
Intermediate/
*.log
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
